            <div xml:id="d404">

                <pb facs="0591" n="481" xml:id="pg481"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/5485: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-20T12:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">March 20,
                                1928—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 3:43 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>138. General McCoy took oath of office as Chairman of the National Board of
                    Elections this morning before the Supreme Court.</p>
                <p>[Paraphrase.] General McCoy and I hope to have the decree issued on March 21.
                    [End paraphrase.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
